  "interpretation_boundary": "This engineering gate battery was sealed after disclosed development calibration and before test coordinates were opened. Every nonempty contiguous action in a sampled training word is confined to train. Broad depth metrics test held-out primitive tables; the separate final-action assay also confines the full word action to test but does not certify a globally novel group element. Exact QR stability gates are architectural integrity checks; accuracy, composition specificity, and intervention gates are learned outcomes. Stage A uses complete transition tables, an operator-shaped 8x8 latent channel, and fixed G=I. It compares whole hard-QR and soft-penalty treatments with different effective initial dynamics and compute, not a formal factorial, statistical noninferiority test, learned invariant metric, spontaneous operator discovery, or semantics richer than the eight-state codebook.",
